{"meta":{"id":"project-scale","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"프로젝트 규모","subtitle":"(테스트~대규모 비교)","summary":"테스트(목업)/소규모/중규모/대규모별 구조 비교","tags":["aide","규칙","프로젝트","규모","스캐폴드"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-commands","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 border border-indigo-200/50 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>\n      1-rules\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Common Rules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    프로젝트 규모 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-indigo-400 font-serif\">(테스트~대규모 비교)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/50 border border-indigo-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 프로젝트 규모(테스트/소규모/중규모/대규모)별 백엔드·프론트엔드 구조 규칙\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">새 프로젝트를 시작할 땐 구조를 손으로 만들지 않고 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">3-modules/3-scaffold의 해당 규모 폴더를 그대로 복사</strong>한다</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">규모가 커질수록 서버 개수, 환경 분리 방식(conda→docker), 프론트 구조(components/pages→features/)가 단계적으로 바뀐다</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">이 myWiki 프로젝트 자체도 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">소규모 스캐폴드를 그대로 복사</strong>해서 시작했다 (0-docs/1-configs/2-frontEnd/3-backend/4-data/5-rules/logs/deploy)</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">규모별 비교</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">4단계</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[24%]\">구분 및 규모</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 w-[24%]\">서버 구성</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[52%]\">핵심 특징</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-stone-700 bg-stone-200/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[목업]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">테스트(목업)</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">서버 1개</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">검증·프로토타입, 순수 HTML/CSS/JS, 프론트는 백엔드 종속</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[소규모]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">소규모</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">서버 2개</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">도메인 2~3개, React(+Vite) 시작, conda/docker 택1 <span class=\"text-indigo-500 font-semibold\">(← 이 myWiki)</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[중규모]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">중규모</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">서버 3개+</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">도메인 4개+, 백엔드 도메인 우선 구조, 프론트 features/ 기반, docker 필수</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-purple-700 bg-purple-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[대규모]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">대규모</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">프로젝트 N개</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">서로 다른 프로젝트를 우산 레포로 묶음, 코드 공유 없이 인프라 컨벤션만 공유</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">다음 단계로 넘어가는 신호</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">목업 → 소규모:</strong> 도메인이 5개를 넘거나 실사용자가 생기면</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">소규모 → 중규모:</strong> 백엔드가 서비스 하나로 감당이 안 돼 서버가 3개 이상 필요해지면</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">중규모 → 대규모:</strong> 프로젝트 자체가 여러 개(서로 다른 배포 단위)로 쪼개지면</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Common Rules</span>\n  <span>프로젝트 규모</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/common-rules/project-scale","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}